WEBVTT

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.980
One day.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.370
It's almost time for the culture festival!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.630
What's the culture festival?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.370
Huh? You don't know, Sonya-chan?

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.290
You wear this,

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.250
and you hold this.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:56.400
Then it's the culture festival!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.640
Now you try, Sonya-chan!

00:01:58.640 --> 00:01:59.430
Like hell!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:15.080
It's finally the culture festival, so I should do a research presentation.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.080
You? What kind?

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.910
Like...

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.380
How long I can hold my breath for.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.160
So an elementary kid's game.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:28.720
Alright, Sonya-chan. Keep an eye on my time.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.790
Why me?

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.270
I'm pushing the boundaries of humanity!

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.320
Ready...!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.520
How many seconds was that?

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.600
Eight seconds.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:49.050
What?! It was definitely longer!

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.470
Do you even know how to use a stopwatch?

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:52.430
What was that?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.540
You're hopeless.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.780
I'll do you this time—

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.490
It stopped...

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.550
C'mon, Sonya-chan. Hold your breath!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.180
I promise it'll be fun!

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.370
This is dumb.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.450
At this rate, mankind's record for "longest time breath held" will stay at eight seconds!

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:15.020
Are you okay with that, as a member of humanity?

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.880
You don't count as a member of humanity.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.890
So you don't think you can beat my record!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.710
Ready?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.490
Yes.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.220
Are you holding it, Sonya-chan?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.860
Are you holding it?

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.320
Are you really holding it?

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.660
You can't, Sonya-chan!

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.120
You won't get a good record unless you stay still.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.480
She's saying I can do whatever I please.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:52.590
Agiri-san, can you read Sonya-chan's mind?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.380
Well, I am a ninja.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.420
Wow! Is there anything else you can tell me?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.570
Let's see...

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:03.530
Her favorite animal is the hippo.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.630
She's breaking three minutes.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:14.430
She can hold her breath quite well.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:17.190
Hey, Sonya-chan, are you okay?

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.620
I think she enjoys ignoring me.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.280
Why don't you try insulting her?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:24.950
Yeah!

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.940
Sonya-chan, you idiot!

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.540
Idiooooooot!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.070
Damn it! Damn it!

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:39.970
In that case, I have to see if she really is holding her breath!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.110
It's not moving...

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:57.230
She says that, even when she's holding her breath, she can use her techniques.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.580
I get it already!

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.210
She's <i>still</i> going...

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.590
She's saying that she's about to break the record.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.930
After she does, she'll stop.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.570
That's a bit frustrating...

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.130
Five seconds left.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.210
Four...

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:18.760
Three...

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:19.840
Two...

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.230
Sonya-chan!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:24.970
Alright! I stopped her from breaking the record!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:29.270
I'm not going to hold your breath, I'm going to end your life.

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.890
It's dangerous to hold your breath, so let's not do it.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.070
For you.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.630
I know! This next study is amazing!

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:42.440
Which area of the school has the best water?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.280
In order to check, we'll have to drink water from every location!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.280
Huh...?

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.380
I drank it all.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.870
My stomach's all flabby now.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:10.490
So, which is it?

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.320
Which is what?

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:18.310
Sonya-chan!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.430
Have you heard?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.900
The other class will be doing a cafe!

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.290
We gotta do that too!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.370
Why?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.560
C'mon, Sonya-chan.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.850
We'll be maids together!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:30.870
No thanks.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:33.330
You're saying that again?

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.350
Tripping while carrying a tray...

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:39.270
Making an error in their order...

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:39.250
Um... Um...!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:42.150
Don't you think that suits you?

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:49.600
In any case, we should host a shooting range instead of a cafe.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:52.340
We can't do something that dangerous.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.960
It'll be fine if we use air guns.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.890
But it'll still hurt when it hits you.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.220
Kid's might come, you know.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.420
How about knife tossing?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.750
That's even more dangerous.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.250
Forks?

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.230
Something smaller!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.570
Ahh, this is safer.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.700
Isn't this something entirely different?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.470
Memorial service for old knives.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:19.440
If not a cafe, then how about we go the traditional route with a haunted house?

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.120
Hell no.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.390
How's that fun?

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:23.780
It's fine!

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:26.230
We'll be the one's surprising people, so it won't be scary.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:28.380
That's true, but...

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.510
Give it a shot!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.060
Are you scared?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:39.440
I was really scared when I noticed...

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:39.980
Huh?

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.990
Athletic festival.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.580
The 100 meter run is now starting.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.820
Ready!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.420
Yay! Sixth place!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.000
Sonya-chan, what place did you come in?

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.080
Second.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.260
There's no reason to use all my energy running for this.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.930
I guess that's the normal excuse.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.710
Ready...!

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:27.980
What's bothering you?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.580
Occupational disease.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.650
I know what you're up to.

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:46.780
The cavalry battle starts in the afternoon.

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:49.590
We can team up with whoever we want.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:52.300
Let's do our best, Sonya-chan, Agiri-san.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.800
Why am I with you?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:57.460
Because there's no one else to team up with, right?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.980
But the cavalry battle has four people per group.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:06.230
That's right. If only we had another person to join us...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.260
Now the time comes for my assistance!

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:19.670
I'm no longer a useless character!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:24.540
What'll we do? We have no one to stand on top.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.330
This is such a problem.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.900
What will we do?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.640
Leave it to me!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.410
Oh, you've come!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.690
We were hoping you'd come!

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.300
Please help!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.640
Boss!

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:36.820
Just leave it to me!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.730
Urgent union, ride on!

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.920
Advance, everyone!

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.720
Our victory awaits!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.390
So cool!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.860
I'm so cool!

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:51.740
Just wait, everyone!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:53.470
I'm coming!

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.860
I've found our fourth.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:00.430
Is something starting?

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.980
I lost to that old man...

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:10.130
I should be the one who goes on top.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.120
I am the leader, after all.

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:13.740
Don't decide that on your own.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.610
Eh? But I wanna ride!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.880
It feels nice to be on top.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.280
I don't want you being on top.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.820
So mean!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:26.400
How about I get on top and win using ninja technique?

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:28.540
Ninja technique: Flame jutsu.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:32.720
You toss this flame scroll right into the enemies.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.280
That's a really bad joke, so no.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.340
How about tear gas?

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:38.630
No to that too.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.080
I'm the best choice to go on top.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:46.670
Agiri-san is dangerous, and whenever you get excited you toss knives.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:50.270
As if! Besides, can you even win against other teams?

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.100
Of course I can!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.010
How about we test that, then?

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.970
A battle to see who can take off the other's hat!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.930
Come at me anytime.

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:06.140
<i>Such good defense!</i>

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:07.940
Ah! A UFO!

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.120
Now!

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.600
Seriously, how old is that trick?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.450
It really was a UFO!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.690
Looks like I win.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.080
It's unfair to use your ninja techniques!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:32.380
No, that's not a ninja technique...

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:39.320
So who's going to ride on top?

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.550
I don't know.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:45.170
No helping it. In this case...

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.440
Disqualified.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.900
Look, look, Sonya-chan!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.440
Ta-da! Beanbags!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.420
Why do you have those?

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:04.590
I found the ones my grandma gave to me.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.890
Do you know how to play with them?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:07.330
No.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:09.420
You use these...

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:12.210
...to hit someone in the face for fun!

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.880
I was lying! I was lying!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.600
I was lying...! I'm sorry!

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:38.250
I actually wanted to become a performer.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.850
You're pretty much one already.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.790
I wanna try a street performance.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.970
They did it yesterday on TV!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.990
<i>She let that stuff get to her again?</i>

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:50.480
So today we commemorate my first step!

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:52.030
Watch me, Sonya-chan!

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.930
I just messed up...

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.400
One more!

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.130
Huh? Huh?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.890
Damn it! Damn it!

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:06.970
So it really is a toy for hitting people in the end.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.490
That's odd...

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.580
I used to be able to do it...

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.790
I remembered how!

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:16.200
Ooh! I'm doing it!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.190
Nice.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:17.900
Right?!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:19.630
I can make money at this level!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.430
I have to become a pro!

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:22.890
I didn't say that.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.130
Ahh... I'm amazing.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.330
I might be a genius.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:29.480
This again?

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:31.670
There are a ton of people who can do that.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.670
Well, can you do it, Sonya-chan?

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.900
I can do the same thing with knives.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.090
It's a trick! A trick!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.780
How is it a trick?

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.860
I bet it isn't even a real knife!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.090
I'll check it!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:49.190
I was injured by a toy!

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:50.640
Blood came out!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.770
It's real.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.230
Damn it! You show off!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.620
I'll interrupt you!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.730
Oh, what happened? I can juggle even more!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.410
In that case...!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.010
I'm sorry.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.200
It's delicious if you cook and eat it.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.680
So, juggling's no good.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.690
What other street performances can I do?

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.460
You still want to do that?

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.490
What do you think I'd be good at?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.050
You could easily be a clown.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.740
But my nose isn't red!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.870
That's not what I meant...

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.410
Your way of life.

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:55.590
What about pantomime? You don't need to use tools.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.750
Wouldn't it be hard to be good?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.480
Don't worry! There are some easier ones!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.460
Invisible chair!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.340
Oh wow, you're amazing already.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.810
Wait! What was wrong with that?

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.480
It's pointless.

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.600
It's much more interesting than your knife trick.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.600
It's not a trick!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.540
That's right! Knives won't make people smile!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.520
If that pisses you off, then try to make me smile by using a knife!

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:19.520
Smile.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.480
Sorry...

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.940
If you squeeze these, violet juice will come out.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.080
In that case, we've not no choice.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.110
We'll be organ grinders.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.420
You jumped on a completely different topic.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:33.310
Where are you going to get a monkey?

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:36.080
Let's start by having you somersault through a ring.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.830
Here!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.940
Ow! Ow!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:40.670
That's not it!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.110
I meant to say plate-spinning!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.860
You said somersault!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.160
You misheard me! It happens a lot!

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:50.930
Alright! I'm gonna go to the home economics room and borrow a plate!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.060
That's enough already!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:59.290
The only thing they weren't using was a pot...

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.970
So why did you bring it?

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.100
While we have it, try spinning this.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.460
How?

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.470
Don't we have a pole here?

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.320
If you don't mind an umbrella, there's one over there.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:13.810
Well?

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:15.040
"Well," what?

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:17.750
I just thought of it, so I wanted to try it out.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.470
Here, try it.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.150
First, we'll do it normally.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.260
I'm sorry. I just...

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.240
At any rate, a pot is used to boil water!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.030
It's not something you spin around!

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.230
I know that.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.660
Goodness. I'll go return it.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:47.260
Alright! They had plates!

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:48.200
Go return them!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.250
It sleeps through the winter.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.430
Good night.

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:59.310
That reminds me, how do those performers blow fire in shows?

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.240
They eat something spicy.

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:05.080
Making fun of me... I know that's not it!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:08.480
Oh, you're an idiot, so you don't know.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:11.890
If you eat something <i>really</i> spicy, you can really blow fire.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.430
That's how everybody does it.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.050
Sonya-chan, you liar!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.560
I don't buy that one bit!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.710
The next morning.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:30.570
Something terrible has happened to Oribe-san, so she'll be absent for today.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.580
Another day.

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.300
What sort of charm is that?

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:48.740
Ah! There it is!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.480
No, that's not it! There was a mosquito!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.590
Mosquito season is over.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.880
They show up sometimes!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.730
Look!

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:58.180
Ah, you're right.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:02.440
But since you didn't apologize... this is your punishment!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:08.650
It bit me earlier.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.860
Just leave it alone.

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:14.260
It sucks when you're bitten, and it might bite again.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.550
Ah, it just bit you.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.730
What? Hell no!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:19.700
Damn it!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.840
Where did it go?

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.830
You'll even kill a mosquito?

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.950
And wait, you're mad about it, too.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:26.980
No, I'm not!

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:28.470
Yes, you are!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:30.160
You even took out your knife!

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.060
Got it!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.350
You didn't need to hit me for that...

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:36.760
The mosquito was there.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:40.130
You're just saying that as an excuse for hitting me!

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.980
I'm not you. I don't lie like that.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.410
I'll take it out...

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:47.770
...with all my strength!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.930
There we go. I took it out.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:55.390
Wow!

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:01.300
Wh-What is it?

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:06.490
Well, whatever. Your knives are still dangerous.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.580
This is more effective, and it's safe!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.950
So don't complain even if I hit you.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.800
You fully intend to hit me, don't you?

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.190
Won't it land soon?

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:19.930
Land where?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.920
Ah! It came right for me!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:27.420
Ah... I hit my face with it!

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:29.530
I'll die from disgust...

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:31.230
It'd be better to use your hands.

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.750
Damn it! Damn it!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.930
Your movement is too inefficient.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.070
You're right...

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.280
Ah! I have an idea!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.100
Now I can miss and it'll be pretty!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.290
Annoying...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.210
Yay!

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:53.990
<i>My pride won't allow me to miss like that again...</i>

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:56.420
<i>This'll be easy if I focus...!</i>

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.260
There it is!

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.420
There it is!!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.580
Ah, it flew off again.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:06.900
Hm? What's wrong?

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:07.730
Give that to me!

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:08.830
I'll use it!

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:12.770
Damn it! Damn it!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:16.790
Playing with bubbles now?

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.780
You little...!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.780
C-Calm down!

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:26.810
I found this in the classroom, so use it instead.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:30.430
"Quickly kill those annoying little pests"...

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:43.430
Don't they say that if you put all your strength into your arm while being bitten, it can't pull out?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.930
I've heard that, but...

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.270
Alright! Let's get bitten so that we can catch it!

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.770
Isn't that just a superstition though?

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:57.180
It doesn't come near us when we wait.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.350
Damn. It stopped there!

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:06.160
They've lost sight of their goal.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.290
It didn't go for my arm, but my head again!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.420
Now's your chance! Pur all your strength into your head and keep it there!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.740
That's awful!

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:27.040
Sonya-chan, the mosquito is over there!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:27.880
Shut up!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.370
First I'm going to take care of you!

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.330
Wait!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:40.180
Why do mosquitos bite the worst places?

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.140
They have their own circumstances.

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:46.180
But maybe that was the last mosquito of the year.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.440
If you think about it that way, it seems better.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:50.170
How?

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:53.750
Some of the bugs are annoying throughout the year.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:56.920
Is that true?

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.760
Wait up, Sonya-chan!

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:02.430
What do you mean by annoying bugs all year round?

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:10.020
Culture, Bean Bags, Cavalry Battle.

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:43.610
Romance of the one girl, two boys, and Three Kingdoms.
